  {
    "kind": "p",
    "text": "Packs expand Live with additional instruments, sounds, and devices. To install Packs, go to Live’s Browser → Packs, and click Install on any available Pack. Packs you’ve purchased or included with your license are also available in your Ableton account. Learn more about Installing Live Packs.",
